Package: com.xsxs18.mylittleenergy
Name: MyLittleEnergy
Version: 1.0.13
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Battery manager for rootless jailbreaks. Charge limit with heat protection and schedules, detailed battery values, history graphs, charging sessions, a live HUD, status bar info, battery icon colors, a lock screen charging animation, alerts with sounds and speech, automation rules, widgets and a Control Center toggle. Free to use; no account or activation required.
Maintainer: xsxs18-dev
Author: xsxs18-dev
Section: Tweaks
Depends: firmware (>= 16.0), mobilesubstrate (>= 0.9.5000)
Conflicts: com.xsxs18.voltix
Replaces: com.xsxs18.voltix
